meta {
  name: Get Showing FAQ
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/question/faq
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Get Showing FAQ

  This request is used to get showing FAQ in the welcome page (Maximum to fetch 8 item). This request interacts with the MySQL database.

  ## Responses

  **200 — FAQ fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "faq fetched",
    "data": [
      {
        "faq_question": "lorem ipsum?",
        "faq_answer": "consectetuer adipiscing elit"
      }
    ]
  }
```

  **404 — faq failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "faq not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}